  "title": {
    "rendered": "Flood Response Working Group Reference Notes"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<p>The Flood Response Working Group has successfully finalised its initial Terms of Reference with the publication of the Flood Response – Capacity Building &#8211; Reference Note. This document is accessible via the ‘<a href=\"https://insarag.org/technical-reference-library/flood-response/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Technical Reference Library</a>’ tab . The Working Group is now dedicated to formulating its 2025–2027 Terms of Reference to advance further knowledge-sharing initiatives. Heartfelt congratulations to all members of the Flood Response Working Group and contributors to this reference note for their exemplary efforts.</p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>The Flood Response Working Group has successfully finalised its initial Terms of Reference with the publication of the Flood Response – Capacity Building &#8211; Reference Note. This document is accessible via the ‘Technical Reference Library’ tab . The Working Group is now dedicated to formulating its 2025–2027 Terms of Reference to advance further knowledge-sharing initiatives. [&hellip;]</p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
